What changed:
- `src/router.ts`: split pattern/path on `/` after stripping leading/trailing slashes and the `?query` part of path; static segments must equal, `:name` segments match one non-empty segment, trailing `*` requires ≥1 remaining segments joined with `/` as `rest`; each segment `decodeURIComponent`-ed; length/param mismatches return `undefined`; `*` anywhere but last throws `TypeError`.
- `src/router.test.ts` (new): 17 tests covering static match/mismatch, segment-count mismatch, single/multi params, empty param, trailing slash both sides, query string, percent-decoding, wildcard one/many segments, wildcard+params, wildcard empty (incl. `?`-only) no-match, wildcard decoding/trailing-slash/query, non-final `*` `TypeError`, root `/`.

